   "sentenceId": 0,
   "he": "קִילְקוּלֵי הַמַּיִם שֶׁבִּרְשׁוּת הָרַבִּים וְכוּ׳. חֲטִיטָה — אִין, חֲפִירָה — לָא.",
   "en": "«damaged water» cisterns «in the public domain and» clean them out by removing the dirt and sediment that has accumulated in them. The Gemara infers: «Cleaning» out the cisterns of dirt and sediment during the intermediate days of a Festival «is» indeed permitted, but «digging» a new cistern «is not» permitted."
